{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_female","model_identifier":"halfling_female","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_female\n\nHalfling female villager (A1), 1.0 m = 36 u to the top of the head (bun reaches 37).\n\nMuch smaller than the males, as intended. Blonde hair in a bun, rosy cheeks, green laced bodice over a linen blouse with rolled sleeves, brown skirt to mid-shin with a linen apron and bib, big bare hairy feet. Baseline skeleton and slot names; only pivots moved.\n\n- Cubes: 25 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.0..8.0, y 0.0..37.0, z -5.0..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 13 x 37 x 10 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | breathing, look around |\n| `walk` | 0.75 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.5 | loop |  |\n| `farm_work` | 1.2 | loop | key 0.45 s: hoe blade bites the soil (worker hoe stroke) |\n| `carry` | 0.85 | loop | walk cycle holding a load at slot_carry |\n| `wave` | 1.6 | loop | friendly greeting / cheer |\n| `cower` | 0.8 | loop | crouched, arms over head, trembling |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | hit from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on her back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 0.75 s\n- `run`: 92.4 u/s (2.60 m/s), cycle 0.5 s\n- `carry`: 26.7 u/s (0.75 m/s), cycle 0.85 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `farm_work`: key 0.45 s: hoe blade bites the soil (worker hoe stroke)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 36, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 22.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 24.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (3.5, 28.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 21, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (6.5, 13.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-9.5, 17.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-6.5, 13.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 16, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 16, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `hoe` (hidden preview under slot_hand_r): the standard D1 hoe, 43 u; long for her, so the stroke is a short chop\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- farm_work: second grip 9 u (25 cm) along the hoe handle\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `halfling_female_mustard.png`: mustard bodice, moss-green skirt\n- `halfling_female_brown.png`: brown bodice, ochre skirt, darker blonde hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- The skirt is a fixed upper skirt on the hips plus two hem halves on the thighs (skirt_hem_r/l) that flare with the stride, so legs do not poke through.\n"},"description":"# halfling_female\n\nHalfling female villager (A1), 1.0 m = 36 u to the top of the head (bun reaches 37).\n\nMuch smaller than the males, as intended. Blonde hair in a bun, rosy cheeks, green laced bodice over a linen blouse with rolled sleeves, brown skirt to mid-shin with a linen apron and bib, big bare hairy feet. Baseline skeleton and slot names; only pivots moved.\n\n- Cubes: 25 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.0..8.0, y 0.0..37.0, z -5.0..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 13 x 37 x 10 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | breathing, look around |\n| `walk` | 0.75 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.5 | loop |  |\n| `farm_work` | 1.2 | loop | key 0.45 s: hoe blade bites the soil (worker hoe stroke) |\n| `carry` | 0.85 | loop | walk cycle holding a load at slot_carry |\n| `wave` | 1.6 | loop | friendly greeting / cheer |\n| `cower` | 0.8 | loop | crouched, arms over head, trembling |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | hit from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on her back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 0.75 s\n- `run`: 92.4 u/s (2.60 m/s), cycle 0.5 s\n- `carry`: 26.7 u/s (0.75 m/s), cycle 0.85 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `farm_work`: key 0.45 s: hoe blade bites the soil (worker hoe stroke)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 36, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 22.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2, 24.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (3.5, 28.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 21, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (6.5, 13.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-9.5, 17.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-6.5, 13.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 16, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 16, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `hoe` (hidden preview under slot_hand_r): the standard D1 hoe, 43 u; long for her, so the stroke is a short chop\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- farm_work: second grip 9 u (25 cm) along the hoe handle\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `halfling_female_mustard.png`: mustard bodice, moss-green skirt\n- `halfling_female_brown.png`: brown bodice, ochre skirt, darker blonde hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- The skirt is a fixed upper skirt on the hips plus two hem halves on the thighs (skirt_hem_r/l) that flare with the stride, so legs do not poke through.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,13.0,-3.0],"to":[5.0,17.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,13.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[44,57,54.0,61.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[82,57,88.0,61.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[54,57,64.0,61.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":